    "created_at": "2019-06-24T23:00:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-06-24T23:00:45Z",
    "body": "+1 to [Cached] - it's basically what we do in Blink, and end up writing `[SameObject, SaveSameObject]` to enable autogenerated caching.\r\n\r\nAside: I'd love to put [SameObject] on IDBObjectStore and IDBIndex's `keyPath` attributes, but they can produce string or Array-of-string results. So if we can drop the restriction requiring the type to be `object` or an Interface, I'd like that too.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
